  m_text: "Story:\nYou are slowly shrinking, and need to make a cure.\nUsing the
    Ingridients in the level, \nand recipies found on walls and clipboards. \n you
    can make the 3 \"Key\" ingridients.\nDifferent maskines do different things so\ntry
    to match them with the recipies you find to make new ingridients.\n\nControlles:\n\"Left-Click\"
    to interact with machines.\nhold \"Right-Click\" to pick up objects.\n\"R\" to
    restart.\n\"H\" to toggle this menu.\n\nTutorial level will be added soon.\nGood
    luck!"
